# Claude Desktop local scheduled tasks (Desktop: Code tab > Routines, Local).
# The Desktop app creates, edits (its Edit form, or a running task calling the
# update_scheduled_task MCP tool) and deletes scheduled-tasks/<name>/SKILL.md.
# That file holds only the prompt: schedule, folder, model and enabled state
# live in the app's own registry outside ~/.claude, so a versioned SKILL.md
# could not recreate a task on another machine. Deliberately unversioned
# (#399); task inventory: ~/repos/.routines/README.md.
# MUST stay ignored: ~/.claude is an exact_ dir, so an unlisted top-level
# entry is DELETED on chezmoi apply.
scheduled-tasks/

